    <string name="settings_backup_replace_warning">Everything currently in Whip—including tasks, Habits, Goals, Tracks, workouts, settings, reminders, and scheduled work—will be replaced by this backup. Whip creates a private recovery snapshot before replacement starts. If replacement fails, Whip rolls back immediately; if the app or device is interrupted, Whip recovers on next launch. After replacement succeeds, your previous local data can be recovered only from a backup you exported.</string>
